## **1. What exactly is this model?**

Fish Audio S2.1 Pro is a neural speech synthesis model designed to generate natural-sounding human speech.

The Free variant available through OpenRouter is described as having the same synthesis capabilities as the paid S2.1 Pro model, rather than being a smaller model with reduced speech quality.

Its main capabilities include:

- Natural-sounding speech generation.
- Multilingual speech synthesis.
- Expressive delivery and emotional variation.
- Voice selection and voice-reference support.
- Multi-speaker dialogue.
- Streaming audio generation.

Fish Audio advertises support for **83 languages**, including English, Japanese, Chinese, Korean, Spanish, Arabic, French, German and Portuguese.&#x20;

