POST https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/audio/speech
```

Authentication uses your OpenRouter API key:

```
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY
Content-Type: application/json
```

Unlike ordinary chat-completion requests, successful speech requests return raw audio bytes rather than a JSON response containing generated text.

OpenRouter also supplies an `X-Generation-Id` response header, which is useful for tracking requests and troubleshooting.&#x20;

