  "voice": "YOUR_FISH_VOICE_ID",
  "response_format": "mp3"
}
```

OpenRouter's Fish integration maps voice references to Fish Audio's `reference_id` mechanism.

Fish Audio also documents voice cloning using reference audio. OpenRouter's TTS guide describes reference recordings as `input_references`, with optional transcripts. This is a different mechanism from selecting an already saved voice.&#x20;

